OL,3,GNEWSATrio hired BMW car to target
OL,4,Astudent and film rape
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have been jailed after they
OL,7,Fhired a BMW car with the sole purpose
OL,8,Fof targeting a woman so they could film
OL,9,Fthemselves sexually assaulting her.
OL,11,FArjan Purewal, Jaskaran Thandi and
OL,12,FHassan Jangheer picked up and drove
OL,13,Ftheir victim up and down Broad Street
OL,14,Fin Birmingham in September 2023 before
OL,15,Fheading to the Clent Hills in
OL,16,FWorcestershire.
OL,18,FThe student was filmed by Purewal as
OL,19,Fshe was subjected to a serious sexual
OL,20,Fassault before being dumped in Vine
OL,21,FLane in Clent at about 03:30 BST.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
