OL,3,GNEWSATrio hired BMW car to target
OL,4,Astudent and film rape
OL,5,
OL,6,FPurewal, from Oldbury, was jailed for
OL,7,Feight years and six months for offences
OL,8,Fincluding rape and blackmail. Thandi
OL,9,Fand Jangheer, from the West Midlands,
OL,10,Fwere jailed for six years for aiding
OL,11,Fand abetting rape.
